# Pre-Event Dinner Briefing — environment variables
#
# By default this agent uses OAuth-connected accounts (Calendar, CRM, call recorder, email, Slack)
# and needs NO keys here. Only fill these in if a system requires an API key that isn't handled by
# the OAuth connection.

# Example (uncomment and set if needed):
# CRM_API_KEY=your-crm-api-key
# CALL_RECORDER_API_KEY=your-call-recorder-api-key
